      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">At BikeHaul, our zero‑scratch guarantee isn’t just a promise—it’s a meticulously engineered process that turns every mile into a safe passage for your bike. The journey from Bangalore to Gulbarga is long, winding, and full of uneven surfaces. To keep your frame, paint, and delicate components pristine, we start with a hydraulic ramp trailer that lifts the bike onto a level deck, eliminating the risk of accidental drops or impact during loading. Once the bike is secure, we deploy strategically placed wheel chocks that lock the wheels in place, preventing any rotational movement that could rub against the trailer or each other.

