<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Bangalore to Gulbarga | Call 8409531615
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does it typically take to transport a bike from Bangalore to Gulbarga?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The standard transit time for bike transport from Bangalore to Gulbarga is 2‑3 days. Our dedicated hydraulic ramp trailers travel the 850 km corridor via National Highway 44 and the express freight lanes, ensuring minimal stops and swift delivery while maintaining full safety protocols.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is provided for my bike during the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every bike shipment is covered by a 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. This policy safeguards the full market value of your two‑wheeler against loss, theft, or accidental damage, and claims are processed quickly through our dedicated support team.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time while it’s on the road?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our satellite‑linked GPS system offers live tracking on a secure dashboard. You receive instant notifications at key milestones—pickup, loading, departure, and arrival—so you can monitor your bike’s exact location throughout the Bangalore‑to‑Gulbarga journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors influence the cost of bike transport from Bangalore to Gulbarga?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is determined by the base distance charge, fuel surcharge, insurance premium, and any optional services such as extra padding or expedited handling. Seasonal demand, vehicle size, and specific pickup/drop‑off locations may also affect the final quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do I need to prepare my bike in any special way before pickup?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We recommend a quick pre‑check: ensure the fuel tank is no more than a quarter full, remove loose accessories, and note any existing scratches. Our team will handle the rest, securing the bike with wheel chocks, high‑tensile lashings, and the 7‑layer foam wrap.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Why should I choose Shree Ashirwad over other movers and packers for this route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad boasts over 22,000 successful bike moves, ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management, and a 4.9/5 Google rating. Our specialized two‑wheel carrier fleet, hydraulic ramp trailers, and zero‑scratch guarantee make us the most reliable choice for Bangalore‑to‑Gulbarga bike transport.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
